6:["$","p",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__lede","children":["12 月 14 日，上海，一场小型的闭门讨论，席位按方向和报名顺序确认。 一份表，投资人和创始人、工程师都能填。两分钟。",["$","br",null,{}],"Dec 14, Shanghai. One closed-door session, seats confirmed by fit and order of sign-up. One form for all three, whether you invest, build or engineer. Two minutes."]}]
7:["$","section",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__verifySection","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__msList","children":["$","a",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__msRow","href":"/v/form","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__msPeriod","children":"报名"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__evTitle","children":"填报名表"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__msDesc","children":"名字、机构与职位、你在做的事、微信号。 Fill in the sign-up form."}]]}]]}]}]}]
8:["$","section",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__section","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__lede","children":"「验证」在这里是指拿别人能复核的记录和证据，确认一个 AI 系统是不是像它说的那样： 模型版本有没有被换过，评测结果别人能不能重跑一遍，用了多少算力能不能对得上。 有的今天就能查，有的还查不了。不需要 AI 背景。"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"page-module__E0kJGG__lede","children":"Verification here means records and evidence someone else can re-check: whether the model version was swapped, whether an evaluation can be re-run independently, whether compute use adds up. Some of this is checkable today, some is not."}]]}]
